{
  "id": "evaporation_from_a_water_surface",
  "title": "Evaporation from a Water Surface",
  "description": "Calculator for water evaporation from open surfaces like pools and tanks. Computes evaporated water amount and required heat supply based on water temperature, air conditions, and surface parameters.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Evaporation from a Water Surface Calculator\n\nCalculate the amount of evaporated water and required heat supply from an open water surface based on:\n\n**Evaporation Formula:**\n- _gh = Θ × A × (xs - x)_\n  - gh = amount of evaporated water per hour (kg/h)\n  - Θ = (25 + 19v) = evaporation coefficient (kg/m²h)\n  - A = water surface area (m²)\n  - xs = maximum humidity ratio of saturated air at water temperature (kg/kg)\n  - x = humidity ratio of air (kg/kg)\n\n**Heat Supply Formula:**\n- _q = hwe × gs_\n  - q = heat supplied (kW)\n  - hwe = evaporation heat of water (kJ/kg)\n  - gs = evaporated water per second (kg/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "water_temp",
          "label": "Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "air_velocity",
          "label": "Air Velocity Above Water Surface",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "defaultValue": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "surface_area",
          "label": "Water Surface Area",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m²",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "xs_humidity",
          "label": "Maximum Saturation Humidity Ratio (xs)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/kg",
          "defaultValue": 0.014659
        },
        {
          "id": "x_humidity",
          "label": "Air Humidity Ratio (x)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/kg",
          "defaultValue": 0.0098
        },
        {
          "id": "evaporation_heat",
          "label": "Evaporation Heat of Water",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 2454
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "evaporation_coeff",
          "label": "Evaporation Coefficient (Θ)",
          "unit": "kg/m²h",
          "formula": "25 + 19 * inputs.air_velocity",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "humidity_diff",
          "label": "Humidity Ratio Difference (xs - x)",
          "unit": "kg/kg",
          "formula": "inputs.xs_humidity - inputs.x_humidity",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "evap_per_hour",
          "label": "Evaporated Water per Hour (gh)",
          "unit": "kg/h",
          "formula": "(25 + 19 * inputs.air_velocity) * inputs.surface_area * (inputs.xs_humidity - inputs.x_humidity)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "evap_per_second",
          "label": "Evaporated Water per Second (gs)",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "formula": "((25 + 19 * inputs.air_velocity) * inputs.surface_area * (inputs.xs_humidity - inputs.x_humidity)) / 3600",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_supply",
          "label": "Required Heat Supply (q)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "formula": "inputs.evaporation_heat * (((25 + 19 * inputs.air_velocity) * inputs.surface_area * (inputs.xs_humidity - inputs.x_humidity)) / 3600) / 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_supply_btu",
          "label": "Required Heat Supply",
          "unit": "Btu/h",
          "formula": "inputs.evaporation_heat * (((25 + 19 * inputs.air_velocity) * inputs.surface_area * (inputs.xs_humidity - inputs.x_humidity)) / 3600) / 1000 * 3412",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}